From: ice <tonimayloneya@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:47:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] codec: mediacodec: retry ranked decoder candidates

Rank mixed Dolby Vision and HEVC candidates, reject negative scores, and relax profile filtering when no eligible candidate remains. Keep the component blacklist and separate failure records for each MIME/name pair.

Retry startup and runtime failures with safe decoder retirement, and fall back to other modules after candidate exhaustion. Add selection, failure and allocation regression tests and document the policy.

Validated host candidate tests with ASan/UBSan, MediaCodec profile and MKV Dolby tests, and Android ARM64 module/test cross-compilation. Device playback validation remains pending.
